item.description:
Fans of the movie Wicked will love playing this themed UNO card game! With a deck featuring graphics inspired by favorite characters and scenes, players try to match colors and numbers &mdash; there&rsquo;s even a special &ldquo;Defy Gravity&rdquo; rule that will have players flying (well, skipping) by opponents like Elphaba herself! And when down to a last card, you&rsquo;ll be do popular if you sing out &ldquo;UNO!&rdquo;
&bull; The UNO game players love features graphics inspired by characters from the beloved movie Wicked! &bull; Game play matches the classic card game where players match colors and numbers to get rid of all their cards. &bull; The special &ldquo;Defy Gravity&rdquo; rule lets a player skip other players based on how many green cards they have in their hand. &bull; Special graphic symbols added to each card help identify the color(s) on that card, allowing players with any form of color blindness to play! &bull; When down to one card, don&rsquo;t forget to yell, &ldquo;UNO!&rdquo;
- description from publisher
